[C2] innovation distribution, and the volatility-feature interaction
     feat_vol != 0 ties the dispersion of the features to the conditional
     volatility of the target.  Heteroskedasticity ALONE costs nothing; what
     the scalar correction cannot see is the within-window covariance between
